" Invariants of the edits that act on a dash as well as on a note: a digit and
" `=` (see invariants/setup.vader and invariants/edits.vader).

Include: invariants/setup.vader

Execute (the edits checked here):
  let g:inv_note_keys = []
  let g:inv_dash_keys = ['7', "a7\<Esc>", "=Am\<CR>"]

Include: invariants/edits.vader
